975:I will preserve the protected layout and original heavy-draft policy, place all three wave-19 palisades before finishing any lagging build step, and keep the Spark Rig selected throughout. Bounded batches of idempotent Rig orders will consume the reported Blast cooldown before an explicit center-stop charge, preserving continuous Rig fire without busy-polling one failed throw per fixed tick. Only the first palisade at `(0,11)` may trigger `REPAIR_UNDER 31`; the side panels remain disposable shot-decoys.
